## Modifications / enhancements

On top of the upstream `lan-gate.mjs`, this release adds:

- Per-IP rate limit raised from 120 to 3000 requests per minute.
- Attachment upload endpoint (`POST /lan-gate/upload`) with a 20 MB per-file cap.
- Automatic 7-day cleanup of uploaded files.
- Phone gallery / camera image picker buttons in the web UI.
- Settings menu layout adjustments (the LAN Access admin panel).

